    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c17c8c78097a93ec62295c29",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感谢大家今天的邀请。能够参加这座我热爱的城市的\n纪念典礼，我和训练员都深感荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efb46326d2bb3d43c94a79419e277a76b1066303151d1232471868b8cd9303a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
