    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41e2b6c2753530f0d92a4570",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "狂怒乐章是非常努力的人，\n在船桥特雷森逐渐崭露头角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "efd9de36fd536b494870a62f28b85f7cdb6e624872ff28e10fbdb1e3fcef3b3a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1079/storytimeline_041079001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dec9617cba44d3262d8189be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今后也一定会成为背负船桥未来的存在。\n在做完正式的致辞后――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ced5d7e9d16b97b711175c4919ef287ee075c04d8f76163c9ce4462bcd58be2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1079/storytimeline_041079001.json",
      "json_path": [
