      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（我要打倒的中央老大为何在这里……？\n是因为中山赛场也在船桥吗……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "00f201c123cf480fde412a5d51e77850151de685f3ecbb2bbe8889001524efeb",
