    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a782f5b53b5b636f0326fadb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "狂怒乐章，我一直很想认真和你交谈一次。\n你的潜力令我十分敬佩！　因此――",
      "source_fingerprint": "daf42692cfaa90322983fbafe4717334305397ea1fa3690580e2949625002b0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
